To build the library with minimum effort you need to have MPFR installed 
somewhere in your $PATH or you need to add the location to 
extra-lib-dirs and include-dirs in HERA.cabal.
You also need GHC and Cabal (usually comes with GHC).

To build and install see 
   
   http://www.haskell.org/haskellwiki/Cabal/How_to_install_a_Cabal_package